Z||000012||87ECO5||11-03-2000||06:52 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MrPBody:<BR><B>87ECO5 -- What kind of paint did you use?  I'm probably doing the same to mine.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Believe it or not, I used engine enamel (primer, basecoat and clearcoat).  Very durable and very shiny!||||reg||1
